{"seq":1,"slug":"compression-basics","title":"压缩的本质与信息论基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms/foundations/compression-basics","wordCount":1479,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"压缩的本质与信息论基础\">压缩的本质与信息论基础</h1><p>随手新建一个文本文件，写满一千个字母 a，再用 gzip 压一下——原本一千字节的文件会缩到三十几字节。换成一千个真正随机的字节，gzip 不但压不动，输出往往还略大于输入。这两个极端揭示了压缩的全部秘密：压缩并不是把信息「变小」，而是把数据里那些本来就多余、可预测的部分剔除掉。能压缩的从来不是信息本身，而是信息的冗余表达。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-压缩为什么可能\">核心概念：压缩为什么可能</h2><p>一段数据可以被压缩，当且仅当它不是均匀随机的。真实世界的数据几乎从不均匀随机：英文里 e 比 z 常见得多，源代码里大括号成对出现，图片里相邻像素颜色相近。这些统计规律意味着数据携带的「实际信息量」小于它的字节数，差额就是压缩可以榨取的空间。</p>\n<p>把这件事形式化的，是一个由「建模」和「编码」两段组成的框架。建模负责估计每个符号出现的概率，编码负责按这个概率把符号变成比特。模型越准，编码越能把常见符号编得短、罕见符号编得长，整体就越小。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[原始数据] --&gt; B[建模&lt;br/&gt;估计符号概率分布]&#10;    B --&gt; C[编码&lt;br/&gt;按概率分配比特长度]&#10;    C --&gt; D[压缩数据]&#10;    D --&gt; E[解码&lt;br/&gt;用同一模型还原]&#10;    E --&gt; F[还原数据]&#10;    B -.共享同一模型.-&gt; E\">flowchart TD\n    A[原始数据] --&gt; B[建模&lt;br/&gt;估计符号概率分布]\n    B --&gt; C[编码&lt;br/&gt;按概率分配比特长度]\n    C --&gt; D[压缩数据]\n    D --&gt; E[解码&lt;br/&gt;用同一模型还原]\n    E --&gt; F[还原数据]\n    B -.共享同一模型.-&gt; E</pre><p>下表对比了「数据像什么」与「能压成什么样」的关系，这是建立直觉的关键。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据特征</th>\n<th>冗余来源</th>\n<th>可压缩性</th>\n<th>典型例子</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高度重复</td>\n<td>串级重复</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>日志、HTML</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>符号偏态</td>\n<td>频率不均</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>英文文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>局部相关</td>\n<td>上下文可预测</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>图像、音频</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>均匀随机</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>几乎为零</td>\n<td>加密数据、已压数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意最后一行：已经压过或加密过的数据接近均匀随机，再压几乎无效。这也解释了为什么「压缩包再压一次」通常没意义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"信息的度量-一个符号值多少比特\">信息的度量：一个符号值多少比特</h2><p>要谈「压到多少」，先得能度量信息。信息论的出发点是：一个事件越不可能发生，它发生时携带的信息越多。一个概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 的符号，其自信息定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I = -\\log_2 p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，单位是比特。概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span> 的符号携带 1 比特，概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>256</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/256</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/256</span></span></span></span></span> 的符号携带 8 比特——后者更「意外」，所以更值钱。</p>\n<p>把所有符号的自信息按概率加权平均，就得到这个信源的熵，它是平均每符号的信息量。熵的精确定义与性质是<a href=\"entropy-redundancy\">熵与冗余</a>的主题，这里只需要记住一个结论：熵给出了无损压缩比特数的理论下界，没有任何无损算法能长期低于它。</p>\n<h2 id=\"唯一可解码与前缀码\">唯一可解码与前缀码</h2><p>把符号编成比特还不够，还得保证解码端能把比特流唯一切回符号。如果 a 编成 <code>0</code>、b 编成 <code>01</code>，那么 <code>01</code> 到底是「b」还是「a 后面跟一个未完成的码」就有歧义。解决办法是用前缀码：任何一个码字都不是另一个码字的前缀。这样解码器从左到右扫描，一旦匹配上某个码字就能立刻确定符号，无需回看。</p>\n<p>前缀码可以画成一棵二叉树，符号都挂在叶子上，从根到叶的路径就是码字。<a href=\"../entropy-coding/huffman-coding\">霍夫曼编码</a>正是构造最优前缀码的经典算法。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    R((根)) --&gt;|0| A[a]&#10;    R --&gt;|1| N1((·))&#10;    N1 --&gt;|0| B[b]&#10;    N1 --&gt;|1| N2((·))&#10;    N2 --&gt;|0| C[c]&#10;    N2 --&gt;|1| D[d]\">graph TD\n    R((根)) --&gt;|0| A[a]\n    R --&gt;|1| N1((·))\n    N1 --&gt;|0| B[b]\n    N1 --&gt;|1| N2((·))\n    N2 --&gt;|0| C[c]\n    N2 --&gt;|1| D[d]</pre><h2 id=\"kraft-不等式-码长不是想多短就多短\">Kraft 不等式：码长不是想多短就多短</h2><p>前缀码的码长不能任意指定。Kraft 不等式给出了硬约束：对一个二进制前缀码，若各码字长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell_1, \\ell_2, \\dots, \\ell_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则必须满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{i=1}^{n} 2^{-\\ell_i} \\le 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ℓ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>直觉上，每个长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span></span></span></span></span> 的码字会「占用」码空间的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{-\\ell}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">ℓ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 份额，所有码字加起来不能超过整个空间。这条不等式的深刻之处在于：把它和熵的定义放在一起，就能证明任何唯一可解码的码的平均码长不可能小于熵——这正是香农信源编码定理的核心。要让平均码长逼近熵，理想码长应取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell_i = -\\log_2 p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，但它通常不是整数，这个「整数 vs 分数」的矛盾正是<a href=\"../entropy-coding/arithmetic-coding-ans\">算术编码与 ANS</a>要解决的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"香农信源编码定理\">香农信源编码定理</h2><p>把前面的线索收拢，就得到压缩理论的奠基性结论。香农信源编码定理说：对一个熵为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 的离散无记忆信源，任何无损编码的平均码长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L \\ge H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span>；同时存在编码使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 任意逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span>（块编码下可以无限逼近）。</p>\n<p>这条定理同时给了我们悲观和乐观两面：悲观的是熵是一道不可逾越的墙，乐观的是这道墙是可以贴着走的。后面所有无损压缩算法的本质，都是在「逼近熵」这件事上各显神通——霍夫曼贴得不错但受整数限制，算术编码和 ANS 贴得更紧。而<a href=\"lossless-vs-lossy\">无损与有损</a>压缩的分野，正在于有损压缩允许重新定义「信息」，从而绕开这堵墙的一部分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>压缩的可能性来自数据的冗余，而非信息本身；均匀随机数据不可压。</li>\n<li>压缩 = 建模（估概率）+ 编码（按概率分配比特），两端必须共享同一模型。</li>\n<li>自信息 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\log_2 p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 度量单个符号的信息量，其概率加权平均即熵，是无损压缩的下界。</li>\n<li>前缀码保证唯一可解码，可表示为二叉树；码长受 Kraft 不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum 2^{-\\ell_i}\\le 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ℓ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 约束。</li>\n<li>香农信源编码定理：平均码长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L\\ge H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span>，且可任意逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span>——这是全 hub 的标尺。</li>\n<li>想压得更狠只有两条路：建更准的模型（<a href=\"entropy-redundancy\">熵与冗余</a>），或允许有损（<a href=\"lossless-vs-lossy\">无损与有损</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"压缩的本质与信息论基础","id":"压缩的本质与信息论基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：压缩为什么可能","id":"核心概念-压缩为什么可能"},{"level":2,"text":"信息的度量：一个符号值多少比特","id":"信息的度量-一个符号值多少比特"},{"level":2,"text":"唯一可解码与前缀码","id":"唯一可解码与前缀码"},{"level":2,"text":"Kraft 不等式：码长不是想多短就多短","id":"kraft-不等式-码长不是想多短就多短"},{"level":2,"text":"香农信源编码定理","id":"香农信源编码定理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"熵与冗余","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms/foundations/entropy-redundancy"}}